    "title" : "10 Pinefield Rd, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer ",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730702434368\" id=\"item-67286a282eb16663fd38e606\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-4245f62b24e6ed830c14\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Generous Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is spacious, with natural light and versatility to accommodate family needs, whether as bedrooms, a study, or a guest room.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>One Well-Appointed Bathroom:</strong> The bathroom is both stylish and practical, offering comfort with quality fixtures and a clean, modern look.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Inviting Living Room:</strong> The heart of the home, the living area provides a cozy and bright space ideal for family gatherings or quiet evenings in.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Functional Kitchen:</strong> A practical kitchen layout with essential appliances and ample storage, making cooking and daily routines easy and enjoyable.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> Offering secure parking and extra storage, the garage provides added convenience for family vehicles and belongings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space for Relaxation:</strong> The outdoor area is perfect for family activities, gardening, or unwinding in a peaceful setting after a busy day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in a family-friendly Auckland area with close proximity to schools, parks, shopping, and dining, 10 Pinefield Rd presents a wonderful opportunity for families or professionals seeking a well-rounded lifestyle. Embrace the comfort, space, and convenience of this lovely Auckland home.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67286a8ccb750313fa6e1a5e&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67286a8ccb750313fa6e1a5e&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730696809221_207086\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"67286a9fd5766257a7cd52e3\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.s